tions about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Stressing Information in Sentences - Expressing Likes and Dislikes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You add emphasis or stress to the words in a sentence that are the most important. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can change the word you stress if another word is more important, such as a like or dislike. Stressed words can also be adjectives like <span class = \"italic\">big, difficult</span> and  <span class = \"italic\">very.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: I <span class = \"strong\">don't</span> like that shirt. The word<span class = \"strong\"> don't</span> is stressed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Likes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I <span class = \\\"strong\\\">like</span> my new sweater and sunglasses.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class = \\\"strong\\\">adore</span> everything in that store.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class = \\\"strong\\\">love</span> your new jacket and tie. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Dislikes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">He <span class = \\\"strong\\\">doesn't</span> like shopping very much.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I really <span class = \\\"strong\\\">don't</span> like shopping.</span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">I <span class = \\\"strong\\\">hate</span> waiting in line.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an experience, moment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am having a good time at the party.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk about shopping.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to buy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pay for something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I buy a lot of gifts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "kind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "nice, gentle", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That was very kind of you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to like", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to enjoy something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like everything in that store.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an accessory you wear around your neck", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:I love your new jacket and tie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "belonging to you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(pronoun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are like mine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to suit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look good on someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those sunglasses suit you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Long i Sound", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To make the Long i sound: </br></br>Step 1: First, move your tongue towards your bottom teeth so it sits low in the mouth. </br> Step 2: Close your jaw slightly and move your tongue upward until it is near the top of your mouth, behind your teeth. </br></br>This is similar to the position of a y sound.</br> ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The Long i Sound in Words", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Spelling \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"igh\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"night, fight, light\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"i_e\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nice, spice, rice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ie\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pie, tie, die\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-y\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ply, sky, dry\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-y-\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cycle, dynamic\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Put the words with the long <span class=\"italic\">i</span> sound in alphabetical 